<view class="page">
  <view class="identity-hero">
    <view class="hero-kicker">INTERNAL IDENTITY</view>
    <view class="hero-title">完善内部身份资料</view>
    <view class="hero-desc">资料仅用于协作区内部辨认和权限分配，不是微信实名认证，也不会公开展示。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice-card">
    <view class="notice-title">填写说明</view>
    <view>请填写狮友常用真实姓名并选择所属服务队。管理员会根据姓名、服务队和账号尾号核对身份。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-card">
    <view class="avatar-editor" bindtap="chooseAvatar">
      <view class="avatar-preview">
        <image wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" src="{{avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        <text wx:else>上传照片</text>
      </view>
      <view class="avatar-action">点击选择本人照片（可选）</view>
      <view class="avatar-help">照片仅用于内部成员名册辨认，可随时重新上传替换。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="field-group">
      <view class="field-label">姓名</view>
      <input
        class="input {{focusedField === 'name' ? 'is-focused' : ''}}"
        data-field="name"
        maxlength="30"
        value="{{name}}"
        bindinput="onNameInput"
        bindfocus="onFieldFocus"
        bindblur="onFieldBlur"
        placeholder="例如：大奇"
        placeholder-style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); -webkit-text-fill-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);"
        cursor-color="#8B5CF6"
        confirm-type="done"
        always-embed="true"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field-group">
      <view class="field-label">所属协作区或服务队</view>
      <picker
        class="picker-control {{focusedField === 'organization' ? 'is-focused' : ''}}"
        range="{{organizations}}"
        range-key="name"
        value="{{organizationIndex}}"
        bindtap="onPickerOpen"
        bindchange="onOrganizationChange"
        bindcancel="onPickerCancel"
      >
        <view class="picker-value">{{organizations.length ? organizations[organizationIndex].name : '暂无组织数据'}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="account-row"><text>账号尾号</text><text>{{accountSuffix}}</text></view>
    <checkbox-group class="consent-row" bindchange="onConsentChange">
      <label>
        <checkbox value="accepted" checked="{{consentAccepted}}" color="#2563eb" />
        <text>我已阅读并同意</text>
      </label>
      <text class="policy-link" catchtap="openUserAgreement">《用户服务协议》</text>
      <text>和</text>
      <text class="policy-link" catchtap="openPrivacyPolicy">《隐私保护指引》</text>
    </checkbox-group>
    <view class="consent-help">系统将收集姓名、所属组织及你主动上传的照片，用于内部身份核对、成员名册展示和权限分配。</view>
    <button class="save-button" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || !organizations.length || !consentAccepted}}" bindtap="save">保存内部资料</button>
  </view>

  <view class="privacy-note">不要求上传身份证、证件照或进行人脸识别。请勿在姓名栏填写手机号、身份证号等敏感信息。</view>
</view>
